      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "content": "## Setup (one-time)\n1. Open the \"Kynetic CRM Email Webhook Auth\" credential (Webhook node) and set a header name (e.g. X-Webhook-Secret) and a secret value you generate.\n2. Put that exact header name + value into the CRM's Vercel env vars (N8N_EMAIL_WEBHOOK_URL, N8N_EMAIL_WEBHOOK_HEADER_NAME, N8N_EMAIL_WEBHOOK_HEADER_VALUE).\n3. Activate this workflow, then copy the Production webhook URL from the trigger node into N8N_EMAIL_WEBHOOK_URL.\n4. Confirm the Gmail node is using the \"Abdullah Kynetic account\" credential.",
